OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officers sacked for
OL,4,A'despicable' on-duty filming of
OL,5,Avulnerable people
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe police ombudsman submitted files to
OL,8,Fthe Public Prosecution Service (PPS)
OL,9,Fbut they directed that neither should
OL,10,Fbe prosecuted. However, on Friday, the
OL,11,FPPS said they would review this
OL,12,Fdecision.
